{"id": "10th-u2-q079", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "kaatre_vaa", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "walt_whitman", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாரதியார் யாருடைய புல்லின் இதழ்கள் (Leaves of Grass) போன்ற வசன கவிதைகளால் ஈர்க்கப்பட்டுத் தமிழில் வசன கவிதை எழுதினார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஷெல்லி (Shelley)", "B": "கீட்ஸ் (Keats)", "C": "வால்ட் விட்மன் (Walt Whitman)", "D": "ஷேக்ஸ்பியர்"}, "explanation": "அமெரிக்கக் கவிஞர் வால்ட் விட்மனின் \"புல்லின் இதழ்கள்\" போன்ற புதுமை கவிதைகளால் ஈர்க்கப்பட்டுப் பாரதியார் வசன கவிதையை உருவாக்கினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Inspired by whose American free verse poetry (like \"Leaves of Grass\") did Bharathiyar pioneer Tamil free verse?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Percy Bysshe Shelley", "B": "John Keats", "C": "Walt Whitman", "D": "William Shakespeare"}, "explanation": "Bharathiyar was deeply influenced by the free verse movement of American poet Walt Whitman."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 32, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th T