{"id": "10th-u2-q147", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "thogainilai_thodargal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ummaithogai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இரு சொற்களுக்கு இடையிலும் இறுதியிலும் \"உம்\" என்னும் இடைச்சொல் மறைந்து நின்று பொருள் தருவது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "எண்ணும்மை", "B": "உவமைத்தொகை", "C": "உம்மைத்தொகை", "D": "வினைத்தொகை"}, "explanation": "\"உம்\" உருபு மறைந்து வருவது உம்மைத்தொகை (எ.கா: அண்ணன் தம்பி). \"உம்\" வெளிப்படையாக வந்தால் எண்ணும்மை (அண்ணனும் தம்பியும்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What compound is formed when the copulative particle \"Um\" is suppressed both medially and finally?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ennummai", "B": "Uvamaithogai", "C": "Ummaithogai (Copulative compound)", "D": "Vinaithogai"}, "explanation": "When \"Um\" is unexpressed, it is an Ummaithogai; when explicitly voiced, it is Ennummai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 42, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 42", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "pre